# One canonical name and address per person, for `git shortlog`, `git log` and `git blame`.
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>. See https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap.
# This changes how git shows names; it does not rewrite history, and GitHub does not read it. Commits count on a GitHub profile only
# when their author email is a verified address on that account.
# The canonical address is the GitHub noreply address, the same one tameru-compaction-system's .mailmap uses.

